  "summaries": {
    "en": "Early Limgrave routing, Rune farming loops, Great Rune collection, and Elden Lord ending preparation for the base game of ELDEN RING.",
    "ja": "序盤リムグレイブルーティング、ルーン稼ぎループ、大ルーン収集、エルデの王エンディング準備まで解説するエルデンリング攻略ガイド。"
  },
  "category": "soulslike",
  "difficulty": "advanced",
  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552820728-8b83bb6b773f?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "The open world allows sequence breaking—Torrent (the spectral horse) can outrun nearly all early-game enemies, enabling direct access to mid-game areas for Rune farming before defeating any Legacy Dungeon.",
      "Spirit Ashes (summons) are the primary single-player survival tool—upgrade the Spirit Summon (Jellyfish, Lone Wolf, Black Knife Tiche) to +10 before any Legacy Dungeon boss, as they absorb 40–60% of boss aggro in most encounters.",
      "Great Runes from demi-god bosses provide unique passive bonuses that stack with your build—Godrick's Great Rune (+5 to all stats) is the most universally useful and activatable after defeating Godrick in Stormveil Castle.",
      "The Flask of Wondrous Physick (configurable HP boost) is available from the third Church of Marika visited—prioritise finding Crystal Tears to customise it for your build (Opaline Hardtear: +15 endurance, Cerulean Hidden Tear: zero FP cost for 15 seconds).",
      "Remembrances (boss souls) from Shardbearers can be duplicated at Walking Mausoleums—identify which Remembrance provides the most useful item before duplicating, as each Mausoleum duplicates only one Remembrance."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "オープンワールドはシーケンスブレイクを可能にする。霊馬「トレント」は序盤のほぼ全ての敵を追い越せ、どのレガシーダンジョンを攻略する前でも中盤エリアへの直接アクセスとルーン稼ぎが可能。",
      "霊体灰（召喚）はシングルプレイヤーの主要サバイバルツール。どのレガシーダンジョンボスの前にも霊体召喚（クラゲ、孤狼の騎士、黒刃のティシェ）を+10に強化する。大抵のエンカウントでボスの敵意の40〜60%を吸収する。",
      "半神ボスからの大ルーンは積み重なるユニークなパッシブボーナスを提供する。ゴッドリックの大ルーン（全ステータス+5）は最も普遍的に有用で、ストームヴィル城でゴッドリックを倒した後に起動可能。",
      "霊薬の聖杯瓶（設定可能なHPブースト）は訪れた3番目のマリカ教会で入手可能。ビルドに合わせてカスタマイズするために結晶雫を優先して見つける（蛋白質の雫：持久力+15、碧水の雫：15秒間FPコストゼロ）。",
      "シャードベアラーからの忘却録（ボスの魂）は歩く霊廟で複製できる。各霊廟は1つの忘却録のみを複製するため、複製前にどの忘却録が最も有用なアイテムを提供するかを特定する。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Limgrave Opening Route Optimisation",
        "body": "Skip the tutorial optional fight (Grafted Scion) by jumping off the cliff—you die intentionally and skip to the starting point without completing the unwinnable fight. Collect the Tarnished's Furled Finger (multiplayer item) immediately and then ride Torrent directly to the Gatefront Ruins to collect the Map Fragment for Limgrave. With the Limgrave map active, locate all three Sites of Grace in West Limgrave before attempting Stormveil Castle. The three graces provide Rune levelling points for 5 free levels before the first major boss."
      },
      {
        "title": "Early Rune Farming and Margit Preparation",
        "body": "Margit the Fell Omen is the Stormveil gatekeeper boss. Recommended level range: 30–40. The most efficient early Rune farm: the Gatefront Ruins guards (accessible from Torrent before entering the castle) provide 180 Runes each for 10 guards, totalling 1,800 per 90-second loop. At level 35 with the appropriate Spirit Ash (+5 minimum), Margit's first phase can be handled by the Spirit Ash while you attack the tail. Margit's Shackle item (sold by Patches for 5,000 Runes) binds him for 5 seconds during Phase 1—use it when he reaches 50% HP."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Altus Plateau and Forbidden Lands Navigation",
        "body": "The Grand Lift of Dectus connects Limgrave/Liurnia to Altus Plateau and requires both halves of the Dectus Medallion (Fort Haight East in Limgrave, Fort Faroth in Dragonbarrow). Altus Plateau introduces Crucible Knight variants—the most dangerous mid-game enemies. Crucible Knights are vulnerable to Guard Counters (heavy attack after blocking); use a 100% physical damage shield (Brass Shield or Pillory Shield) and counter-attack reliably rather than attempting to dodge their variable attack patterns."
      },
      {
        "title": "Great Rune Activation and Radahn Festival",
        "body": "Great Rune activation requires visiting the corresponding Divine Tower—Godrick's Divine Tower is in Limgrave (accessible before Margit), Radahn's in Caelid (accessible after completing Redmane Castle's Radahn Festival). The Radahn Festival is a multiplayer-style boss fight where NPC summons assist—summon all available NPC signs before engaging Radahn, as they collectively deal 40% of Radahn's total HP before the fight ends. Radahn's Great Rune (+15% HP, FP, and Stamina maximum) is the most powerful defensive Great Rune available."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Elden Lord Ending Path",
        "body": "The primary ending requires defeating all major Shardbearers, accessing Leyndell Royal Capital, defeating Morgott the Omen King, reaching the Mountaintops of Giants, and defeating Fire Giant at the Forge of the Giants. Post-Forge, the Fractured Marika sequence leads to the Elden Beast as the final boss. Elden Beast requires elemental immunity strategies (Pearldrake Talisman for non-physical damage resistance) and a 2-weapon loadout with one long-range tool (Greatbow or Bolt of Gransax) to close distance during Elden Beast's flight phases. Hoarfrost Stomp (Spirit Ash: Snowfield) remains the highest burst AoE option for Elden Beast's stationary phases."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Attempting Caelid before completing Limgrave and Liurnia—Caelid is a mid-to-late game area; enemies there are level 60–80 equivalent and one-shot players at standard Limgrave build levels.",
      "Not using Torrent for field bosses—mounted combat on Torrent provides a separate HP bar (Torrent absorbs one lethal hit before dying) and doubles movement speed for repositioning; dismounting for field bosses wastes both advantages.",
      "Spending Runes on Vigor only—the soft-cap at 60 Vigor provides 1,900 HP; levelling above 40 Vigor gives diminishing returns while 40 points in your primary damage stat provides linear damage scaling.",
      "Ignoring the Larval Tear respec system—Larval Tears (found throughout the game) allow full stat reallocation at Rennala; if your build underperforms at mid-game, respec rather than grinding new levels.",
      "Entering Farum Azula without completing Sorcerer Rogier's questline—Rogier's questline provides the Black Knifeprint item that is permanently missable after a specific story event in Leyndell; complete it before the Forge of the Giants."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "赤獅子城と下狭間をリムグレイブとリムグレイブを完了する前に試みる。赤獅子城は中〜後半のエリアで、そのエリアの敵はレベル60〜80相当であり、標準的なリムグレイブビルドレベルのプレイヤーをワンショットする。",
      "フィールドボスにトレントを使わない。トレントでの騎馬戦闘は別のHPバー（トレントは死ぬ前に1回の致命的なヒットを吸収する）を提供し、位置調整のための移動速度が2倍になる。フィールドボスで下馬すると両方の利点を無駄にする。",
      "ルーンを活力のみに使う。活力60でのソフトキャップは1,900HPを提供する。活力40以上のレベルアップは逓減収益をもたらし、主要な攻撃ステータスに40ポイント使うと線形ダメージスケーリングが得られる。",
      "泡沫の雫を使ったリスペックシステムを無視する。泡沫の雫（ゲーム全体で発見される）はレナラでの全ステータスの再割り当てを可能にする。中盤でビルドが低いパフォーマンスなら、新しいレベルをグラインドするより再設定する。",
      "呪術師ログリのクエストラインを完了せずにファルム・アズラに入る。ログリのクエストラインはレンドール王城の特定のストーリーイベント後に永久に見逃せる黒刀の拓本アイテムを提供する。巨人の炎山の前に完了する。"
    ]
  },
